+# Building Visibility on Your Own
+
+## Concept
+
+Visibility is presented as a clear signal moving through a trusted network—not a spotlight or popularity contest. A solo entrepreneur builds a compact “visibility system” from four practical blocks: a clear signal, a credible story, repeated touchpoints, and useful participation.
+
+## Visual arc
+
+The lesson opens by stripping away the noisy trappings of polished branding. A signal line then connects people, conversations, and communities. Four numbered building blocks assemble into a simple system, followed by an AI filter that keeps communication grounded and human. The closing frame resolves into three outcomes: understood, trusted, and referred.
+
+## Direction
+
+- Editorial diagrams and kinetic typography rather than literal stock imagery.
+- Navy field, paper cards, blue connections, and gold emphasis.
+- Calm, capable motion: drawn paths, assembling cards, and restrained highlights.
+- Every scene advances the explanation; decoration stays secondary.
